ity. This Cisco-certified SFP transceiver is ideal for ISPs, corporate offices, data centers, and telecom networks, delivering reliable, low-latency links over single-mode fiber (SMF).</p><p><br></p><p>The module supports up to 10 km transmission distance using 1310 nm wavelength and features Duplex LC connectors. It is hot-swappable, has digital diagnostics monitoring (DDM), and fully complies with IEEE 802.3z 1000BASE-LX/LH standards, ensuring maximum network stability and seamless Cisco device interoperability. Perfect for fiber backbone upgrades, Metro Ethernet, and enterprise network expansion in Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3><ul><li>Product Model: Cisco GLC-LH-SMD</li><li>Form Factor: SFP (Small Form-Factor Pluggable)</li><li>Data Rate: 1 Gbps</li><li>Standards: IEEE 802.3z 1000BASE-LX/LH</li><li>Connector Type: Duplex LC</li><li>Cable Type: Single-Mode Fiber (SMF)</li><li>Wavelength: 1310 nm</li><li>Maximum Distance: Up to 10 km over SMF</li><li>Digital Diagnostics (DDM): Yes</li><li>Hot-Swappable: Yes</li><li>Operating Temperature: 0 °C to 70 °C (Commercial)</li><li>Power Consumption: &lt; 1 W</li><li>Compatibility: Cisco Catalyst, Nexus, ASR, ISR, and other Cisco devices</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-modul